    "## Operator Eigenvalues\n",
    "\n",
    "Demonstrate eigenvalues for each QCAL operator:"
   "source": [
    "def show_qcal_connection(problem_key: str):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Display how a specific problem connects through QCAL.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    if problem_key not in framework.problems:\n",
    "        print(f\"❌ Unknown problem: {problem_key}\")\n",
    "        return\n",
    "    \n",
    "    problem = framework.problems[problem_key]\n",
    "    constant_key = problem['constant']\n",
    "    constant_value = framework.constants[constant_key]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Get default parameters and compute eigenvalue\n",
    "    params = framework._get_default_params(problem_key)\n",
    "    operator = framework.operators[problem_key]\n",
    "    eigenvalue = operator(params)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Get connections\n",
    "    connections = framework.find_connections(problem_key)\n",
    "    verification = framework.verify_problem(problem_key)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Display formatted information\n",
    "    output = f\"\"\"\n",
    "## {problem['name']} in QCAL Unified Framework\n",
    "\n",
    "**Problem Statement**: {problem['statement']}\n",
    "\n",
    "**QCAL Operator**: `{problem['operator']}`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Universal Constant**: `{constant_key} = {constant_value}`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Eigenvalue**: `{eigenvalue}`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Verification Protocol**: {problem['verification']}\n",
    "\n",
    "**Verification Status**: {verification}\n",
    "\n",
    "**Connected Problems**: {', '.join([framework.problems[p]['name'] for p in connections]) if connections else 'None'}\n",
    "\n",
    "### Connection Diagram\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "{problem['name']}\n",
    "    ↓ (via {constant_key})\n",
    "  QCAL Operator: {problem['operator']}\n",
    "    ↓\n",
    "  Eigenvalue: {eigenvalue}\n",
    "```\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    display(Markdown(output))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Example: Show P vs NP connection\n",
    "show_qcal_connection('p_vs_np')"
   ],
   "outputs": []
